PLACEHOLDER: actual inl binary for darwin-amd64 will be placed here by goreleaser/npm-publish workflow.
This file is NOT executable — it will be replaced by the Go binary at release time.

To build locally:
  GOOS=darwin GOARCH=amd64 go build -o npm/inl-cli-darwin-x64/bin/inl .

To verify: after building, `chmod +x` and `./bin/inl --version`.
